WEBVTT

00:16:58.544 --> 00:17:01.999
nisu poklapali s onim 
što smo očekivali.

00:17:01.999 --> 00:17:05.260
Ono što je uzbudljivo u idućem 
desetljeću podataka

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:06.930
u astronomiji jeste to

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.141
da ne znamo koliko odgovora

00:17:09.141 --> 00:17:11.051
nas čeka,

00:17:11.051 --> 00:17:14.822
odgovora o našem postanku
i našoj evoluciji.

00:17:14.822 --> 00:17:15.997
Koliko nas odgovora čeka

00:17:15.997 --> 00:17:19.211
za koje čak ne znamo 
ni pitanja

00:17:19.211 --> 00:17:21.222
koja želimo postaviti?

00:17:21.222 --> 00:17:23.169
Hvala.

00:17:23.169 --> 00:17:26.871
(Pljesak)